      "value": "@{5abb264f453b9a30f3e2a2e7|full_name}: I understand, but that could be changed like, instance owners still can see, or something. I really prefer someone avoiding being kicked from world, than turning my life in real hell inside VRChat servers. For example, I literally cant play in some maps anymore just because theres alot of cancer people i blocked and they still have power to choose if i can play or not, just because they can see me on the Social tab, and ask for new players etc to kick me or offending stuff. Its really anoying since its impossible to report that to moderation, since i've already blocked the players, but the harassing still happens. Need to exists a way to not have contact with people you blocked.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
