      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sorry to tell you but all they need is your user address (it's like a steam I'd) and they can add you to a KoS list on their pc. It automatically sends you home when they enter a room you're in. There are also dlls that bypass blocking all together. What they need is to fix this exploit in their code.",
      "viewerReactions": null
