  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-01-27T21:59:04.399Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My suggestion is basically that, when you are blocked by someone, the person who blocked you does not appear in the \"Social\" tab in a public room. \nWhy? Because since the DLL leak that can disconnect players, it is no use blocking the hacker, because he still can disconnect you by the social tab when at same server. \nAnd besides that, there is no need to know who blocked you, since the person dont want contact with you anymore.",
